      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Mod Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>~ Intro ~</strong></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FMRLhMXVQAEb5aP.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FMRLhMXVQAEb5aP.jpg\" alt=\"FMRLhMXVQAEb5aP.jpg\" /></a></p>\n<p><strong>﻿~ ﻿Included in this mod ~</strong></p>\n<p>31 Funky New Friends</p>\n<p>(These must be found in raid!, you can not buy these from traders or the flea market!)</p>\n<p>Found Via</p>\n<p>Scavs / Players</p>\n<p>Dead Scav Bodies</p>\n<p>Duffle Bags</p>\n<p>Jackets</p>\n<p>Drawers</p>\n<p>Toolboxes</p>\n<p>Safes</p>\n<p><em>~ Recommend Mod ~</em></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2768-allthelootredux\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ALL THE LOOT REDUX  </a></p>\n<p><em><strong>~ Known Issues ~</strong></em></p>\n<p>None</p>\n<p><em>~ WIP ~</em></p>\n<p>Hall Of Fame Placements<br />\nNew Fumos And Plushies</p>\n<p><strong>~ Screenies ~</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tpRFSdR9/Screenshot-2025-07-27-183627.png\" alt=\"Screenshot-2025-07-27-183627.png\" /><br />\nUPDATE 1.1<br />\n14 Plushies Added</strong></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.ibb.co/SYq59NK/Screenshot-2025-07-29-220306.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/SYq59NK/Screenshot-2025-07-29-220306.png\" alt=\"Screenshot-2025-07-29-220306.png\" />  </a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How To Support Me</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/mrpenguin5292\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://ko-fi.com/mrpenguin5292</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/MrPenguin5292\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://www.patreon.com/MrPenguin5292</a></p>\n<p>(This is not needed, but it helps keep the train going!)</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://img.wattpad.com/f93ffc10270c1438c0035f2f3a13d1b00a161cff/68747470733a2f2f73332e616d617a6f6e6177732e636f6d2f776174747061642d6d656469612d736572766963652f53746f7279496d6167652f647038763734706e61474b5075513d3d2d313131393533343731372e313735303166643537373338383062653939393932303336313836322e676966\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://img.wattpad.com/f93ffc10270c1438c0035f2f3a13d1b00a161cff/68747470733a2f2f73332e616d617a6f6e6177732e636f6d2f776174747061642d6d656469612d736572766963652f53746f7279496d6167652f647038763734706e61474b5075513d3d2d313131393533343731372e313735303166643537373338383062653939393932303336313836322e676966\" alt=\"68747470733a2f2f73332e616d617a6f6e6177732e636f6d2f776174747061642d6d656469612d736572766963652f53746f7279496d6167652f647038763734706e61474b5075513d3d2d313131393533343731372e313735303166643537373338383062653939393932303336313836322e676966\" /></a></p>\n<p>SSH - Framework and tons of help</p>\n<p>Various 3D Scanners - Assets<br />\n{.endtabset}</p></div></div></div>\n",
